  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 1802.03 Community resource",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 1802.03 “Community resource” means the river has been identified or recognized by local residents or referenced in a municipal document accepted by the municipality, such as a master plan or a water resource management plan, as being important to the community.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Wq 1800) #8326, eff 4-21-05; ss by #9330, eff 11-26-08; ss by #12185, eff 5-25-17",
